{
  "$comment": "Holders from the record's own person fields (mold_v1-300) and a step's due date anchored to a record's date (mold_v1-302), for the workflow runtime's tests (scripts/test-record-workflow-runtime.mjs, scripts/test-record-workflow-runtime-db.mjs): laid over scripts/fixtures/record-workflows/review.json, never on its own. The deployments area gains three own fields (an assignee and a reviewer, both people, and a target date) and the tasks a reviewer (they have an assignee and a due date of their own); the review is due two days before a deployment's target date, a task's preparation on the task's own due date; the maker-checker document is replaced whole by one whose preparation is held by the record's assignee and whose review by its reviewer, each re-read whenever the step opens again. A test fixture; no deployment ships it.",
  "records": {
    "areas": {
      "deployments": {
        "fields": {
          "assignee": {
            "type": "person",
            "label": "Preparer"
          },
          "reviewer": {
            "type": "person",
            "label": "Reviewer"
          },
          "target_date": {
            "type": "date",
            "label": "Target date"
          }
        },
        "lifecycle": {
          "workflow_due": {
            "review": {
              "field": "target_date",
              "days": -2
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "tasks": {
        "fields": {
          "reviewer": {
            "type": "person",
            "label": "Reviewer"
          }
        },
        "lifecycle": {
          "workflow_due": {
            "prepare": {
              "field": "dueAt"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "workflows": {
      "maker-checker": {
        "_notes": [
          "The neutral maker-checker review with its holders read from the record's own person fields: the preparation is its assignee's, the review its reviewer's, each re-read whenever the step opens again."
